  data: {
    LLM: 'Players take turns adding tiles to either end of a single train. Touching ends must add to seven (1-6, 2-5, 3-4). The four matadors (0-0, 1-6, 2-5, 3-4) may be played on any end; a matador can be placed with either end in line and the open end is the new train end. If there is a zero at an end, only a matador may be played there. A player may choose to draw from the boneyard instead of playing a matador. Game ends when someone plays their last tile (dominoes), the game blocks, or all players pass in one round.',
    Player: 'Players take turns adding tiles to either end of a single train. Touching ends must add to seven (1-6, 2-5, 3-4). The four matadors (0-0, 1-6, 2-5, 3-4) may be played on any end; a matador can be placed with either end in line and the open end is the new train end. If there is a zero at an end, only a matador may be played there. A player may choose to draw from the boneyard instead of playing a matador. Game ends when someone plays their last tile (dominoes), the game blocks, or all players pass in one round.',
    objective: "Be the first to play all your tiles (call Domino) or have the fewest pips when the hand ends. Lowest pips in hand wins the hand; winner is credited with the sum of losers' pips minus own total. Game is played to 100 points. Tie for lowest scores nothing.",
    gameplay: 'Players take turns adding tiles to either end of a single train. Touching ends must add to seven (1-6, 2-5, 3-4). The four matadors (0-0, 1-6, 2-5, 3-4) may be played on any end; a matador can be placed with either end in line and the open end is the new train end. If there is a zero at an end, only a matador may be played there. A player may choose to draw from the boneyard instead of playing a matador. Game ends when someone plays their last tile (dominoes), the game blocks, or all players pass in one round.',
    keyRules: [
      'Touching ends of train and played tile must total seven; matadors may be played on any end.',
      'Blank (zero) at an end forces matador-only at that end.',
